## Tier rationale

Classified `light` (user also pre-constrained light tier): the query is a bounded two-part factual question — enumerate the alloy systems in modern turbine blades and explain their heat tolerance — with rich, settled authoritative consensus (metallurgy texts, NASA reports, OEM documentation). No contested thesis, no conflicting-evidence synthesis, so `full`'s adversarial depth machinery adds cost without insight. `response_format: structured` fits a collect-mode survey of several material systems; register is `teach` ("which X and why" shape); inference_depth `surface`.
EOF
